    "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Hello!\r\n\r\nJust as the title says, I've been trying to implement the `grep_string` picker from telescope in mini.pick. For those who don't know, the `grep_string` picker in telescope will grep for the current word under your cursor.\r\n\r\nI looked to see if there was a way to set the initial query for a picker when opening one in mini.pick, but I didn't find one, so I came up with this:\r\n```\r\nlocal cword = vim.fn.expand '<cword>'\r\nvim.defer_fn(function()\r\n    vim.api.nvim_input(cword)\r\nend, 25)\r\nrequire('mini.pick').builtin.grep_live()\r\n```",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hello!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Just as the title says, I've been trying to implement the <code class=\"notranslate\">grep_string</code> picker from telescope in mini.pick. For those who don't know, the <code class=\"notranslate\">grep_string</code> picker in telescope will grep for the current word under your cursor.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I looked to see if there was a way to set the initial query for a picker when opening one in mini.pick, but I didn't find one, so I came up with this:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"local cword = vim.fn.expand '&lt;cword&gt;'\nvim.defer_fn(function()\n    vim.api.nvim_input(cword)\nend, 25)\nrequire('mini.pick').builtin.grep_live()\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">local cword = vim.fn.expand '&lt;cword&gt;'\nvim.defer_fn(function()\n    vim.api.nvim_input(cword)\nend, 25)\nrequire('mini.pick').builtin.grep_live()\n</code></pre></div>",
    "bodyText": "Hello!\nJust as the title says, I've been trying to implement the grep_string picker from telescope in mini.pick. For those who don't know, the grep_string picker in telescope will grep for the current word under your cursor.\nI looked to see if there was a way to set the initial query for a picker when opening one in mini.pick, but I didn't find one, so I came up with this:\nlocal cword = vim.fn.expand '<cword>'\nvim.defer_fn(function()\n    vim.api.nvim_input(cword)\nend, 25)\nrequire('mini.pick').builtin.grep_live()",
