            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for sharing.\r\n\r\nIn most cases using `:Pick grep pattern='<cword>'` is enough. This might not work with special characters, but those probably won't match the during `<cword>` expansion.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks for sharing.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In most cases using <code class=\"notranslate\">:Pick grep pattern='&lt;cword&gt;'</code> is enough. This might not work with special characters, but those probably won't match the during <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;cword&gt;</code> expansion.</p>",
